# Local object storage (dev/test uploads + quarantine)
# Both roots: LOCAL_UPLOADS_DIR is process.cwd()/uploads, so where files land
# depends on which directory the process was launched from. apps/backend is the
# normal one (dev.sh starts it with --cwd), but a run from the repo root — a
# root-level `bun test`, `bun run dev` — writes to <root>/uploads instead.
# These are real uploaded documents (PDFs, attachments), never source.
apps/backend/uploads/
/uploads/

# TypeScript build info
*.tsbuildinfo

# Graphify temporary cache, visualizers, and raw graph models (keep report tracked)
graphify-out/*
!graphify-out/GRAPH_REPORT.md
apps/graphify-out/
